class: abi
profiles: standard
summary: C initialization with a negative count traps and says what the call needs
program: program.ldn
root: ../../../../..
c-sources: peer.c
c-args: -O2
traps: yes
constructs: 1570, 1580, 1650, 1660, 1960, 1975
targets: linux-x86-64, linux-arm64, darwin-arm64, freebsd-x86-64, freebsd-arm64, linux-rv64
trap_report: landin: _landin_host_initialize_arguments needs a nonnegative argc and a non-null argv
